>What do you have to eat to get poison resistance?  ...


You may now get poison resistance from most monsters which resist poison, but
your chance of getting it depends on the monster's level--don't bother with
killer bees, which are level 1.  Blue jellies, quivering blobs, or
gelatinous cubes are good choices, since you can eat them safely.  (It's not
a 100% chance though--you'll probably have to eat several.)  When you get it,
the message is "You feel healthy!".
